Kanso, a layout for the Herdr app
Copyright 2026 jlopezlira

The kanso-* mods are derived from mods shipped with Herdr
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0), through the
0oz-design fork by 0OZ (https://github.com/0OZ/0oz-design) and the
minimalistic layout by José Gutiérrez (https://github.com/josedugu/minimalistic).
Each file's header lists who changed what.

The markdown panel's reviews (md-review and Done), its Escape key and its
"From this terminal" list come from herdr-md-review by Johannes Hund
(https://github.com/h0ru5/herdr-md-review, Apache License 2.0).

This repository is a fork of the markdown-panel mod from
https://github.com/jlopezlira/herdr-kanso (Apache License 2.0), with changes by
phin-tech: it opens as a split pane, and code blocks have Copy and
Paste in terminal buttons.
